  "content_description": "Recognition Action Item",
  "content_text_body": "Stories are a memorable way to celebrate successes and reinforce expectations.  \n\nWrite out a list of the 20 most impactful efforts or results from your team or department over the past six months. Pick five that reinforce the company values and team mission. Think about how you would tell them as a story:\n\n> Who was involved?\n\n> When and where did it happen?\n\n> What was happening at the time?\n\n> What was the challenge?\n\n> How was the challenge overcome?\n\n> What impact did it have?  \n\nTake a few minutes in meetings and impromptu gatherings to share those stories. See if you can do it once per week for an entire quarter.",
